## Project overview

Describe the work and its context.

## The problem

Who needed this, and what were they trying to do?

## My role and contributions

Distinguish your work from collaborators’ work.

## Technologies and architecture

Explain the implemented components and their data flow.

## Technical challenges and decisions

Describe a specific tradeoff and the evidence behind your choice.

## Implementation and engineering process

Explain how you built and checked it. Include a short, relevant code example if useful.

## Results and impact

Use verified outcomes. Clearly identify missing measurements.

## Lessons and potential improvements

Separate what you learned from proposed future work.

## Screenshots and links

